From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marko Saukko <marko.saukko@jolla.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:48:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add operators missing from the database. JB#66116

Add providers for networks that the Android apns-conf.xml of a recent
MediaTek device lists and we do not have at all, when LineageOS or the
AOSP sample apns-full-conf.xml confirms the internet access point. The
MMS access point is added only when it is confirmed as well.

Names come from the GSMA TS.25 list shipped on the same device, cleaned
up by hand. Networks without a TS.25 name, networks that have been shut
down, and operators we already list under the same name are left out.
---
 serviceproviders.xml | 489 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 489 insertions(+)

diff --git a/serviceproviders.xml b/serviceproviders.xml
